<text font-family="sans-serif" fill="black" x="230" y="230"
      font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">PC 09.180  RoundOtto Checkerboard</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Ottorino Invernizzi 11 Aug 2013</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="266">Angles for R.I. = 1.580</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="284">89 facets + 24 girdles</tspan>
<tspan x="230" y="302">4-fold, mirror-image symmetry; 96 index</tspan>
